Consumer believes PNC Bank breached the terms of a personal checking account promotion : {$400.00} bonus to be posted within 60-90 days of qualifying activities. 

Consumer met the qualification criteria on XX/XX/. As of XX/XX/, the {$400.00} signup bonus as not posted. 

Relief sought : {$400.00}

My name is XXXX. My original creditor was XXXX XXXX XXXX. A third party collection agency LVNV funding LLC purchased old Inaccurate fraudulent debt from XXXX XXXX XXXX which is illegal to do. I knew nothing of LVNV funding. They never reached out to me prior to this. And to make matters worse they have now threatened and sued me for Debt that is inaccurate. I tried to contact there office and no one has gotten back to me to look into this matter. Im very upset about this because no one should have to pay a debt that is inaccurate. I do not consent to paying a third party collection agency that has inaccurate data on my old past debt. I also do not appreciate LVNV Funding LLC threats of suing me. I have never been sued a day in my life and I try to live my life in a very respectful / honest way. LVNV LLC does not operate in a honest way. They are money hungry -third party collection agencies trying to make a quick dollar by suing innocent people. LVNV does not deserve to be operating as a third party collection agency. 

They need to stop harassing innocent American people. Enough is enough! 

LVNV funding LLC license number is XXXX They are Suing me in the amount of {$1900.00}
